3. The following example of one absolute construction enclosed in another is a pretty puzzle for those who like such things: *To the new Greek Note Bulgaria replied by a Note which was returned to the Bulgarian Foreign Minister,* Greece, it being declared, not wishing *to enter into any bargaining.*
