ABSOLUTE POSSESSIVES. Under this term are included the words hers, ours, theirs, & yours, & (except in the archaic attributive-adjective use, as thine eyes) mine & thine.
===
**ABSOLUTE POSSESSIVES.** Under this term are included the words *hers, ours, theirs, & yours,* & (except in the archaic attributive-adjective use, as *thine eyes*) *mine & thine.*
>>>

